  "solution": {
    "text": "We know that,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> has the greatest numerical value where,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>where</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mo>.</mo></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>GIF</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> will be the term with greatest numerical value and<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>86016</mn><mo>.</mo></math>"
